                                     "text":  "A coffee shop in an alleyway~\nThe lattes are delicious and reasonably priced.\n\nThe environment is great: the temperature, cleanliness, and comfortable table and chair heights. The atmosphere is pleasant and perfect for working, reading, chatting, and gatherings. There\u0027s also space for rent. The service is friendly, warm, and patient.\n\nI\u0027ll definitely be back!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "在巷子中的咖啡廳～\n拿鐵好喝 價格適宜\n\n環境好 室內溫度,整潔度,桌椅高度都很舒適\n氣氛佳 適合辦公 讀書 聊天聚會，也有空間租借\n服務態度好 有溫度 有耐心～\n未來會再訪！！",
